Description: HiFiBerry Bluetooth Audio Metapackage
 This metapackage ensures all necessary Bluetooth audio components are
 installed for HiFiBerry systems to function as Bluetooth audio sinks.
 .
 The package pulls in all required dependencies:
 - libspa-0.2-bluetooth: SPA Bluetooth plugin for PipeWire
 - bluez: Linux Bluetooth protocol stack
 - pipewire: Modern audio processing framework
 - pipewire-pulse: PulseAudio compatibility layer
 - pipewire-alsa: ALSA compatibility layer  
 - wireplumber: PipeWire session and policy manager
 .
 After installation, your HiFiBerry system will be capable of receiving
 Bluetooth audio from phones, tablets, and other Bluetooth devices.
 Additional configuration may be needed to enable discoverable mode
 and configure specific Bluetooth audio profiles.
